atters when you're running a skeleton crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Art Strategically</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/2f9e051a887a51fc09feb8a41b79f769.poster.avif?t=1756728796\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/2f9e051a887a51fc09feb8a41b79f769.webm?t=1756728796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/2f9e051a887a51fc09feb8a41b79f769.mp4?t=1756728796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art or Survival?</strong> You need both. Mix and match monument part cards to create bizarre structures that get shipped to space. Precious parts require rare materials like silver and gold - sometimes you'll have to fight for them. But these aren't just for show: each part brings game-changing effects. Heal your workers, instantly complete buildings, attract better merchants, or boost your reputation. Every monument is both a work of art and a strategic choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive, Upgrade &amp; Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/bf2705152e78aedad111d4a87e29c401.poster.avif?t=1756728796\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/bf2705152e78aedad111d4a87e29c401.webm?t=1756728796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/extras/bf2705152e78aedad111d4a87e29c401.mp4?t=1756728796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miss deadlines at your own risk.</strong> Your anxious overlord responds to failure by triggering disasters - sandstorms, enemy attacks, and worse. Fight through hostile territories to expand your settlement and unlock new worlds. Upgrade your workers with earned knowledge. Keep pushing forward until you're strong enough to reclaim your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keep your workers moving. Create monuments strategically. Survive the pressure. Get rid of your shady overlord.</i></p>","developers":["Monoblok Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508530/d39e8185a041218cf48bcc37b117387626db7fee/header.jpg?t=1756728796","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  1.6 GHz (Apple Silicon or Intel)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152457,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152457/movie480.mp4?t=1749276742","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152457/movie_max.mp4?t=1749276742"},"name":"Early Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152457/be7a713cc2e9b6803d9e19e5fb333b203eeba334/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749276742","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152457/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749276742","max"